WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.820
Roosevelt once said, “There’s nothing
to fear but fear itself.”

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:09.290
And that’s how you can tell that he’d
never heard of the SCP Foundation, and faced

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:12.910
some of the terrifying nightmares they deal
with on a daily basis.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:17.920
And today, we’re taking on the frightening
task of comparing and ranking some of the

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.839
scariest SCPs out there for your viewing pleasure.

00:00:20.839 --> 00:00:26.909
While, of course, fear is a highly subjective
concept, at well over 300 videos into our

00:00:26.909 --> 00:00:32.300
tenure, we think we have a pretty good idea
of which SCPs bump hardest in the night.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:37.070
So to start us off, in the immortal words
of another truly terrifying YouTuber:

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.940
Number Fifteen.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:45.210
SCP-087 is an old favorite, and perhaps one
of the most famous SCPs out there, thanks

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:49.809
to classified information about it being leaked
in a certain video game.

00:00:49.809 --> 00:00:53.859
But exposure hasn’t diminished the potent
aura of fear that still lingers at the bottom

00:00:53.859 --> 00:00:56.010
of this sinister staircase.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:01:00.809
If ever you find yourself in the administrative
building of a university campus, you may suddenly

00:01:00.809 --> 00:01:05.720
experience a sense of creeping dread, knowing
that any of the doors around you may lead

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:07.980
you into a living nightmare.

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:13.220
What awaits you is all-consuming darkness
and a seemingly endless descent into the void

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:17.140
below...That is, until the crying starts.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:21.440
Not long after that, you’ll go from hating
the fact you’re alone in this horrible place

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:24.430
to desperately wishing that were the case.

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:30.310
When 087’s infamous inhabitant, the Face,
comes up to greet you, you might even wish

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:32.340
you’d never been born at all…

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:35.610
But enough about a scary place you might stumble
into.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:38.380
This next horror comes straight to you.

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:44.180
If you need to take regular nighttime drives,
for business or pleasure, then SCP-1337 is

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:46.240
bound to be your worst nightmare.

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:51.720
She’s whispered about in urban legends all
over the world: The Ghostly Hitchhiker.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:56.660
She goes by many names, but the only true
name is Mary Talish.

00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:01.390
After being murdered and mutilated in an occult
ritual, her ghost would hitchhike down the

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:06.910
roads of Muncie, Indiana, and take rides back
to the home of her parents, before disappearing

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:08.160
without a trace.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:11.210
A little spooky, but mostly benign.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:16.990
Until one sadistic Foundation researcher decided
to attempt her neutralization by killing off

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:17.990
her parents.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:23.030
In absolute contrast to the researcher’s
plans, this turned Mary from a ghost into

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:24.600
a violent demon.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:28.970
Now taking the form of her own mutilated corpse,
if you see her on the side of the road and

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:32.420
keep driving, your horrible fate is sealed.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:37.120
She’ll appear in your backseat, her hollow
eye-holes burning with fury.

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:42.620
And when they find your car, crashed on the
side of the road, you’ll be dead and mutilated,

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:43.870
just like her.

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:48.860
But if you think this nighttime drive is frightening,
wait until you take a field trip...

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:53.970
Repeat after us: I do not recognize the bodies
in the water.

00:02:53.970 --> 00:03:00.140
SCP-2316 is an anomalous water source, namely,
a large, mist-shrouded lake, and the closer

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:05.800
you get, the more you’ll find yourself unable
to ignore all the bodies floating in the water.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:10.490
You do not recognize the bodies in the water...Or
do you?

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:15.941
Can you tell if it’s SCP-2316’s powerful
cognitohazardous properties taking hold, or

00:03:15.941 --> 00:03:19.570
are those bodies really your old classmates?

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:22.200
The only way to find out is to get closer.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:28.010
And the closer you get, the more certain you
are: Yes, they really are your old friends!

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:29.410
Why did you leave them here?

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:31.160
It’s been so long.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:33.790
Don’t you feel guilty for abandoning them?

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:34.790
You get closer.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:35.790
You get closer.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:36.790
You get closer.

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:37.790
You’re in the mist now.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.330
All those familiar faces.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.470
The water laps at your ankles.

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:42.470
Knees.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:43.470
Waist.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:44.470
Shoulders.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:45.470
Neck.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:46.470
You’re smiling.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:48.650
You recognize the bodies in the water.

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:50.020
They’re your friends.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.740
You’re with them now.

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:55.510
But horror around a dark, misty lake is to
be expected.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:57.800
During a cheerful night at the theatre?

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:58.800
Not so much...

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:03.489
You’ve been vaccinated, after over a year
of careful social distancing.

00:04:03.489 --> 00:04:08.069
So you decide to treat yourself to some live
entertainment: A play being performed by a

00:04:08.069 --> 00:04:11.540
local community theater group, The Hanged
King’s Tragedy.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:16.989
Or SCP-701, as it’s known to the SCP Foundation.

00:04:16.989 --> 00:04:21.939
However, your classy evening quickly takes
a turn for the worst and into an absolute

00:04:21.939 --> 00:04:26.860
nightmare when a strange bound, hooded figure
appears on the stage.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:31.139
From there, not only will the content of the
play become more disturbing - from murders

00:04:31.139 --> 00:04:36.360
to hangings - but the behavior of the audience
will take an even more depraved turn.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:41.710
It will erupt into horrifying violence and
chaos, as seemingly normal people go into

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.850
a lethal frenzy, driven mad by the cursed
play.

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:51.539
Every performance of SCP-701 is doomed to
become a harrowing mass killing.

00:04:51.539 --> 00:04:56.330
Let’s go from the stage to a horror who
prefers to stay out of the limelight...

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.710
He waits in the dark.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:00.419
Pacing, hiding.

00:05:00.419 --> 00:05:01.419
Weeping.

00:05:01.419 --> 00:05:05.460
If ever you see his face, there’ll be hell
to pay.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:11.199
That’s right: It’s the infamous Shy Guy,
SCP-096.

00:05:11.199 --> 00:05:15.990
From its look to its actions, this homicidal
maniac is built from nightmare fuel.

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:20.620
He’s freakishly tall with disproportionately
long limbs and a gaunt, stretchy face with

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.159
a terrifyingly large mouth.

00:05:23.159 --> 00:05:27.840
And if ever you see so much as a photo of
that face, you’ll find out exactly what

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.819
he can do with it.

00:05:29.819 --> 00:05:34.089
SCP-096 will make a beeline for you at breakneck
speeds.

00:05:34.089 --> 00:05:37.999
No chasm or barrier or ocean will stop him.

00:05:37.999 --> 00:05:40.379
No weapon will slow him down.

00:05:40.379 --> 00:05:44.629
He will find you, and he will murder you.

00:05:44.629 --> 00:05:48.930
Your family won’t even have any remains
to bury when he’s done.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:53.520
But you don’t need to look at our next monster’s
face for him to terrify you.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:56.060
Honestly, he doesn’t even really have one...

00:05:56.060 --> 00:06:00.419
First thing’s first: Stay put, and don’t
open the door.

00:06:00.419 --> 00:06:02.840
What, do you think we’re just paranoid?

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.879
Just be quiet and listen.

00:06:04.879 --> 00:06:05.879
Can you hear it?

00:06:05.879 --> 00:06:08.069
The deep, labored breathing?

00:06:08.069 --> 00:06:10.719
The subtle scratching against the wood?

00:06:10.719 --> 00:06:14.500
Even though you can’t see it, you know what
it looks like.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.030
It’s waiting.

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.030
Listening.

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:20.479
Its long, dirty teeth chatter with anticipation.

00:06:20.479 --> 00:06:24.699
Whatever you do, don’t open the door.

00:06:24.699 --> 00:06:30.029
SCP-303, also known as The Door Man, is a
mysterious creature with the ability to manifest

00:06:30.029 --> 00:06:36.120
behind doors or other entryway barriers opposite
a sentient observer, always causing such intense

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:40.639
feelings of dread in his victims that they
find it impossible to open the door or entryway

00:06:40.639 --> 00:06:41.860
barrier.

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:46.339
This fear is so great that some people have
starved to death rather than open the door

00:06:46.339 --> 00:06:47.669
to get food.

00:06:47.669 --> 00:06:49.369
He’s just that terrifying.

00:06:49.369 --> 00:06:54.979
But you’ll be grateful that 303 was keeping
the door closed, if it means you can avoid

00:06:54.979 --> 00:06:57.979
going to our next terrifying location.

00:06:57.979 --> 00:07:03.589
We have a few questions for you: First, have
you been having strange dreams lately?

00:07:03.589 --> 00:07:04.589
Interesting.

00:07:04.589 --> 00:07:08.430
Secondly, do you remember going to a place
called Cragglewood Park in your youth?

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:15.210
It was a strange, wondrous, and slightly unsettling
theme park, full of grinning, singing trees

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:18.949
and the most beautiful carousel you’ve ever
seen.

00:07:18.949 --> 00:07:22.050
Just two more questions: Are you an only child?

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:24.879
Have you always been an only child?

00:07:24.879 --> 00:07:30.830
If you’ve ever visited SCP-2571, Cragglewood
Park, you may have difficulty answering these

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:36.509
questions - Because this whimsical fever dream
beckons pairs of siblings to its twisted carnival

00:07:36.509 --> 00:07:38.330
of smiling trees.

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:44.520
But only one of these two siblings ever leaves,
and the other becomes just one more giggling,

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.240
singing nightmare tree.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.289
Sleep tight, kids.

00:07:47.289 --> 00:07:51.909
But that’s not the most dangerous entity
coming after your kids.

00:07:51.909 --> 00:07:53.080
What are your kids watching?

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:58.939
In an era of unprecedented internet access,
it’s a harder question to answer than ever.

00:07:58.939 --> 00:08:04.229
But you better pray they’re not watching
SCP-993, or they’ll end up as prey for a

00:08:04.229 --> 00:08:07.599
sinister entity known as Bobble The Clown.

00:08:07.599 --> 00:08:11.849
With Bobble, it’s less a question of what
he’ll do to your kids, and more about what

00:08:11.849 --> 00:08:17.110
he’ll make your kids do to you, themselves,
and anyone else unlucky enough to cross them

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:19.179
under his influence.

00:08:19.179 --> 00:08:23.710
His educational programming will teach your
kids about things like murder, self-mutilation,

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:30.870
cannibalism, performing dark rituals, and
believe us, they will be extremely receptive

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:32.449
to his teachings.

00:08:32.449 --> 00:08:37.079
Leave your children with Bobble playing on
the TV, and they’ll be little monsters before

00:08:37.079 --> 00:08:38.190
you know it!

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:39.839
But enough about little monsters.

00:08:39.839 --> 00:08:43.789
How about a really, really big one.

00:08:43.789 --> 00:08:49.209
SCP-1128, also known as the Aquatic Horror,
is a massive underwater predator with unique

00:08:49.209 --> 00:08:54.060
infohazardous properties: Once you’ve had
the beast described to you, you’re in its

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:58.170
sights forever, and you’re not safe near
any body of water.

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:03.699
The monster has devoured its victims in oceans,
lakes, pools, bathtubs, puddles, and in the

00:09:03.699 --> 00:09:09.170
case of one extremely unlucky victim, the
glass of water he was drinking from.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:15.170
It’s a ruthless and terrifying predator,
and once it has you, you’ll be gorily devoured

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:16.199
in seconds.

00:09:16.199 --> 00:09:21.220
They say the one way to escape it is to take
amnestic treatment and forget you ever knew

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:25.140
about the beast, but does that really make
you feel safe?

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:29.420
Will anything make you feel safe now, next
time you’re straying a little too close

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.690
to the water?

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:34.150
But at least SCP-1128 will devour you quickly.

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:37.970
Our next horror loves to take his time.

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:39.920
SCP-106.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:45.540
The Old Man capable of walking through walls,
burning flesh with a touch, and most terrifyingly

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:51.380
of all, dragging you into his private torture
dimension, where he has absolute power.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:56.180
There, he’ll taunt and hurt you for as long
as he pleases, until you’re little more

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:58.269
than a desiccated husk.

00:09:58.269 --> 00:10:03.240
Once he selects his targets, almost nothing
can stop him in his pursuit of them - save

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:06.600
only for the prospect of causing more suffering
elsewhere.

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:14.190
But while 106 takes his time, our next unstoppable
sadist kills whole extended families at once...

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:19.730
If you plan on having a christening, a wedding,
or a funeral any time soon, well, we hope

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:22.720
you’re prepared to plan for plenty more
funerals.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:26.519
Especially if your Cousin Johnny is in attendance.

00:10:26.519 --> 00:10:30.680
Though the Foundation would be more inclined
to call him SCP-2852.

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:36.709
He’s the ultimate, terrifying party-crasher,
and when he manifests in your family function,

00:10:36.709 --> 00:10:39.639
there’s nothing anybody can do to save you.

00:10:39.639 --> 00:10:43.879
He turns these sacred days into orgies of
violence and terror.

00:10:43.879 --> 00:10:49.430
Arcane rituals, murder, cannibalism, self-mutilation,
and more.

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:54.680
Even if you manage to survive one of these
events, you’ll forever be haunted.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:11:00.990
Many die early, all live unfortunate and unhappy
lives, many turn to violence and murder as

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.930
they cannot cope with the horrors they’ve
seen.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:08.250
And worst of all, you never know when it’s
going to be your turn.

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:11.660
After all, Cousin Johnny is everybody’s
cousin.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:17.490
But when it comes to body horror, Johnny doesn’t
hold a candle to our next entry...

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:22.199
These monsters make your standard walking
dead look positively cuddly.

00:11:22.199 --> 00:11:30.949
SCP-610, the Flesh that Hates, is a Sarkicist
nightmare that’s thankfully confined to

00:11:30.949 --> 00:11:33.390
a desolate community in Siberia.

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:39.170
But if it ever got out, then dying before
the change took hold would be a happy reprieve.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:44.450
This hyper-infectious virus transforms you
into a straight-up monster, a fleshy abomination

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:48.990
with only one prerogative: Spread the infection
further.

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:53.060
And if ever you were unlucky enough to be
on the receiving end of 610’s pathogenic

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:57.940
payload, the monster you become couldn’t
even be called a twisted shadow of who you

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:58.980
once were.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.420
The Flesh is Eternal.

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:05.699
It wants to bring us all into its hateful
embrace.

00:12:05.699 --> 00:12:09.970
But there is one body horror event more disturbing
than 610.

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:10.970
Why?

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:13.300
Because it went global.

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:17.800
Learn to embrace the dark, friends, fear the
light.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:24.680
The words that ushered in the incomprehensible
nightmare of SCP-001 - When Day Breaks, an

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:30.850
XK-Class End of the World Scenario where the
sun itself becomes a terrifying anomaly.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:35.910
Exposure to sunlight caused its victims to
melt, while still remaining alive.

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:41.560
These blobs of living human flesh would then
coagulate into giant, amoeba-like masses,

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:45.250
hell-bent on dragging others out into the
light.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:47.810
Most horrors on this list lurk in the darkness.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:52.821
There are few things more profoundly unnatural
than evil not just living in the light, but

00:12:52.821 --> 00:12:55.290
being the light itself.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:13:03.129
Though true horror can often hide in unlikely
places, just like the next entry on our list...

00:13:03.129 --> 00:13:05.730
SCP-4666, the Yule Man.

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:11.280
The king of turning Christmas Cheer into Christmas
Fear, and making Krampus look like jolly old

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:13.970
Saint Nick himself in comparison.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:18.420
Every year, this Yuletide Monster selects
a new series of victims that he stalks over

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:24.120
the Christmas season, preparing to make his
grand entrance in the very heart of winter.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:28.480
And when he does enter, if you’re lucky,
he’ll just leave a morbid toy made from

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:30.959
the flesh of his previous victims.

00:13:30.959 --> 00:13:35.980
If you’re unlucky, he’ll torture and then
butcher the whole family in ways too horrible

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:40.019
to imagine, before kidnapping the youngest
child.

00:13:40.019 --> 00:13:44.981
This child will then be forced into slavery
in the Yule Man’s twisted workshop, and

00:13:44.981 --> 00:13:49.100
if he doesn’t eat them when he gets hungry,
he’ll make their fellow children turn them

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:53.439
into toys when they get too weak or injured
to work themselves.

00:13:53.439 --> 00:13:56.560
It doesn’t come much more evil than this.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:14:02.350
But we can think of one that frightens us
just that little bit more...

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:06.329
SCP-2774, also known as the Slow Burn Sloth.

00:14:06.329 --> 00:14:07.509
Surprised?

00:14:07.509 --> 00:14:10.339
Perhaps you’ve never even heard of this
one before, and you’re wondering how it

00:14:10.339 --> 00:14:15.660
could beat out classics like SCP-096 and SCP-106.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:19.990
After all, it’s just a memetic image of
a man in a janky sloth costume that sometimes

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:23.460
appears in media, both recorded and live.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:28.730
But if you do happen to see this strange little
image, everything you hold dear is about to

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:30.579
be taken away from you.

00:14:30.579 --> 00:14:35.329
The scariest thing about a lot of the monsters
on this list is the way they’ll kill you.

00:14:35.329 --> 00:14:41.130
The scary thing about 2774 is that it won’t
kill you at all - You’ll just wish it had.

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:46.660
When the memetic infection takes hold, you’ll
slowly lose all cognitive functions.

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:50.480
You can no longer move or even think on your
own.

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:56.569
Your body is on slow-motion autopilot for
the majority of the day, save for 150 seconds

00:14:56.569 --> 00:14:58.350
every 24 hours.

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:04.319
During those lucid periods, victims will often
beg to be put out of their misery.

00:15:04.319 --> 00:15:10.380
The Slow Burn Sloth isn’t gory, shocking,
or sadistic, it’s worse: It’ll trap you

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:16.350
in the prison of your own mind, reducing you
to less than an infant, but fully conscious

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.399
of all you’ve lost.

00:15:18.399 --> 00:15:23.350
Your own little sunken place, where the only
release is death.

